{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":18860788,"ns":0,"title":"Continuous emissions monitoring system","extract":"Continuous emission monitoring systems (CEMS) are used as a tool to monitor the effluent gas streams resulting from combustion in industrial processes. CEMS can measure flue gas for oxygen, carbon monoxide and carbon dioxide to provide information for combustion control in industrial settings.","description":"Tool to monitor the effluent gas streams resulting from combustion in industrial processe","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}